@start README.md
# Payments service

Settles, refunds and reconciles payments for the orders service.

## History

The service talked to the legacy gateway from 2019 until March 2026.
The `legacySettle` path and the `PAYMENT_LEGACY_*` codes date from that
period and were removed in PAY-812.

## Running it

`npm run dev` after `npm run db:migrate`.
